## **PRIVACY LAYER (Cross-Layer Protection)**

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    PRIVACY INPUT GATE                                 │
│  Data Classifier → Purpose Validator → Access Controller            │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                              │
                              ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    PRIVACY AGENT GATE                                 │
│  Data Masker → Context Filter → Permission Enforcer                  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                              │
                              ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    PRIVACY OUTPUT GATE                                │
│  Output Sanitizer → Compliance Checker → Audit Logger                 │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Privacy Agents (9 Total):**
| # | Agent | Role | When Activated |
|---|-------|------|---------------|
| 1 | Data Classifier | Classify sensitivity | Every input |
| 2 | Purpose Validator | Validate business purpose | Every request |
| 3 | Access Controller | Check permissions | Every data access |
| 4 | Data Masker | Sanitize sensitive fields | Before agent processing |
| 5 | Context Filter | Filter by role & task | Before agent processing |
| 6 | Permission Enforcer | Enforce rules | Real-time |
| 7 | Output Sanitizer | Clean output | Before delivery |
| 8 | Compliance Checker | Validate regulations | Before delivery |
| 9 | Audit Logger | Record all access | After every interaction |